        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bart Conner, Nadia Comăneci, Paul Ziert\n- Organizations: Bart Conner Gymnastics Academy\n- Places: Norman, Oklahoma, Montreal\n- Topics: Olympic gymnastics, perfect 10, recruiting\n\nFacts:\n- Nadia Comăneci was born on November 12, 1961.\n- In 1976, Nadia Comăneci became the first gymnast to receive a perfect score of 10.0 at the Olympic Games in Montreal when she was 14 years old.\n- Paul Ziert recruited Bart Conner to the school.\n- Bart Conner currently owns and operates the Bart Conner Gymnastics Academy in Norman, Oklahoma, with his wife Nadia Comăneci.\n- Nadia Comăneci is a Romanian Olympic gold medalist.",
